Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?OpenIntra=20Edition:=20eigene=20Themes=20beim?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20Start=20mit=20Farben,=20=E2=80=9Ewie=20System=E2=80=9C=20fol?=
 =?UTF-8?q?gt=20OpenIntra?=
